Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: %empty
    2        | program function
    3        | COMMENT program

    4 function: FUNC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY
    5         | FUNC type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

    6 function_call: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN parameters RIGHTPAREN

    7 new_parameters: %empty
    8               | new_parameter
    9               | new_parameters COMMA new_parameter

   10 new_parameter: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER

   11 parameters: %empty
   12           | expressions
   13           | expressions COMMA expressions

   14 statements: %empty
   15           | statements statement

   16 statement: new_variable
   17          | new_array
   18          | function_call
   19          | print
   20          | RETURN expressions SEMICOLON
   21          | COMMENT
   22          | BREAK SEMICOLON
   23          | CONTINUE SEMICOLON
   24          | if_statement
   25          | while_statement
   26          | read_statement
   27          | write_statement
   28          | assignment

   29 new_variable: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   30             | type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN NUMBER SEMICOLON

   31 variable: NUMBER
   32         | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
   33         | array_get_pointer
   34         | function_call

   35 new_array: type LEFTBRACKET NUMBER RIGHTBRACKET TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON

   36 array_get_pointer: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTBRACKET NUMBER RIGHTBRACKET

   37 type: INT

   38 print: PRINT LEFTPAREN variable RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   39 assignment: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expressions SEMICOLON
   40           | array_get_pointer ASSIGN expressions SEMICOLON

   41 expressions: %empty
   42            | expressions expression

   43 expression: variable
   44           | LEFTPAREN expression RIGHTPAREN
   45           | expression PLUS expression
   46           | expression SUBTRACT expression
   47           | expression MULTIPLY expression
   48           | expression DIVIDE expression
   49           | expression MODULUS expression

   50 boolean_expressions: expression GREATER expression
   51                    | expression LESS expression
   52                    | expression LESSEQUAL expression
   53                    | expression GREATEREQUAL expression
   54                    | expression EQUALITY expression
   55                    | expression NOTEQUAL expression

   56 if_statement: IF LEFTPAREN boolean_expressions RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY else_statement
   57             | IF boolean_expressions LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY else_statement

   58 else_statement: ELSE LEFTCURLY statement RIGHTCURLY
   59               | %empty

   60 while_statement: WHILE boolean_expressions LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY
   61                | WHILE LEFTPAREN boolean_expressions RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

   62 read_statement: READ LEFTPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   63 write_statement: WRITE LEFTPAREN expressions RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON


